OL,3,ATwo Israeli soldiers killed in attack
OL,4,Aby suspected Palestinian gunmen in West
OL,5,ABank
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo Israeli soldiers have been killed
OL,8,Fin a shooting by two suspected
OL,9,FPalestinian attackers in the occupied
OL,10,FWest Bank, the Israeli military says.
OL,12,FThree other Israelis were wounded in
OL,13,Fthe attack before the gunmen were shot
OL,14,Fdead at a checkpoint at an entrance to
OL,15,Fthe city of Hebron, officials say.
OL,17,FPrime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said
OL,18,Fthe military would "destroy" the Hebron
OL,19,Fneighbourhood that the two attackers
OL,20,Foriginated from, and that Israel was
OL,21,Fready for "extensive action" in the
OL,22,FWest Bank.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
